    "chunk_text": "\u0dba\u0db6\u0dcf\u0dba \u0dcf\u0db8 \u0dc3\u0dbb\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dd2 \u0dd0\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dba \u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db8\u0db1\u0dd2. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dba \u0da2\u200d \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bc6\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) The Hon. Sajith Premadasa, Leader of the Opposition.\n\n[12.11 p.m.]\n\nHe possessed certain unique characteristics, characteristics which are important in embarking on accountable and responsible public service. At all times, he represented his constituency, the people he loved, exhibiting kindness, empathy and sympathy and always made it an effort to promote policies which benefited his people, his constituents.\n\nSir, he was a strong advocate of humanism. He was always of the opinion that Sri Lanka should remain one country, that Sri Lanka\u2019s political independence, sovereignty and territorial integrity must be protected, enhanced and maintained. He was very vociferous in expressing his opinions, both within and outside Parliament. He stood by principles; he was a conviction politician. He had the noble characteristic of recognizing the spectrum of opinions, the plethora of opinions on any given subject, using a rational methodology to arrive at conclusions and deductions.\n\nHe championed the cause of the people, not merely of the people in the North and the East, but of all the people living in our motherland, in all of the nine provinces, the 25 administrative districts, the 341 AGA Divisions spreading across 14,021 Grama Niladhari Divisions and 51,000 micro-villages. He was particularly interested in ensuring that the divisions which existed within our society were addressed and eradicated. He was a strong supporter of inclusive growth and shared prosperity. On\n\n1147 1148\n\n[\u0dd0\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db6\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dbd\u0dca \u0dbb\u0dad\u0dca\u0dc4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8 \u0dcf]\n\n2025 \u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 2"
