    "chunk_size_bytes": 2174,
    "chunk_text": "there in all of us. The ability to highlight their empathy, to be able to act with empathy, to be able to understand and relate to someone else\u2019s experiences - the suffering, emotions, feelings of someone - and to respond accordingly is what we are seeing emerging slowly in our country. So, I think, with all humility, we must acknowledge that that is beginning to happen, that this stirring of our conscience, the flourishing of goodness, the expectation that people would act with the goodness within all of them is happening, that that space is slowly emerging. Therefore, I think we need to acknowledge that; I think it is important that we acknowledge that because this is how change and transformation begins.\n\nWe, as a Government, have consciously, always and consistently tried to promote ideas that bring about unity, respect, empathy, accountability and respect for human rights. We have consciously done that; all the Representatives of our Government, starting from our President, have consistently spoken about all of this. It is important that the Government, starting with the President, consistently maintain this narrative, this discourse, that we have stood by our pledge not to resort to racism and to provoke violence and hatred as a means of survival and maintaining our power. That is an important shift which, I think, we need to acknowledge. We have restored, I think to a great extent, the respect for the rule of law or at least the expectation that the law will function fairly without discrimination from top to the bottom, that the law will apply equally to all. All this is important. Our interventions when it comes to mass graves, the detention of people and all of that have attempted to correct ourselves when things have gone wrong.\n\n\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0dca\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dd4 \u0dba (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b95\u0bc1\u0bb4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Chairperson of Committees) \u0db1\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d85\u0db1\u0db8 \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8 \u0dc4 \u0dd2, \u0d94\u0dbd\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8 \u0dc4 \u0dbd \u0dab\u0dc0 \u0dd2\u0dc1 \u0dcf\u0da9\u0dd2 \u0dca\u200d\u0dda\u0dda \u0dda\u0dcf\u0dbd \u0d8b \u0d9a\u0dca\u0d9a\u0dba \u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dbd \u0dc0\u0dcf."
  },
