    "md5": "669ca69a2996a6a1c6ca585b9fc9f9d6",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2030,
    "chunk_text": "\u0dd4 (\u0d86\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) \u0dad\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0dbb\u0dc3\u0dd6\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0dba (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bb2\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0bb9\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bbf \u0b85\u0bae\u0bb0\u0b9a\u0bc2\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0baf) (The Hon. (Dr.) Harini Amarasuriya) We have tried our best to correct when things have gone wrong because, as I said, we had to inherit a legacy where things had gone wrong and where institutions have not transformed as much as we, as a Government, would have expected them to. So, when things went gone wrong, we have been willing to re-correct and also listen\n\n2481 2482\n\n[\u0db1\u0dbb\u0dd4 (\u0dbb\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dca ) \u0db1\u0dca\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0db8\u0dbb\u0dd6 \u0db1\u0dca \u0db8 \u0dab\u0dcf]\n\n2025 \u0d85 \u0db1 \u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dc0\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8 22\n\nWe also understand the indivisibility and the intersectionality of human rights. This is why, for us, socio economic development is fundamentally important, why addressing gender concerns is fundamentally important and why we acknowledge how class, gender, race and caste play a role in how human rights are experienced by people. We understand that and that is why we acknowledge this in how we work and how we plan and that we consider all of these rights as equally important and have to be paid attention equally. That is especially why when it comes to sectors like education, our policy is that we will leave no child behind. So, when there are special needs among the Malaiyagaha Community or in the North and the East, we will make special provisions; we will take extra effort. And, when it comes to development in areas which have been underserved, we will make special efforts because we understand how these rights are linked to each other.\n\nSo, Madam, once again, I would like to thank the Hon. Sivagnanam Shritharan for raising this and even in his Adjournment Motion, he has raised many of the issues that are linked with each other. Therefore, this, I think, is an extremely good move where instead of speaking of selected issues of a selected community, we are able to widen this discussion to talk about human rights, as they affect every aspect of our lives."
  },
