    "md5": "05cdf9f7329a3ada76ba06cdfa180ae3",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1851,
    "chunk_text": "Having said that, let me also speak about another matter since the Hon. Minister of Foreign Affairs is in the Chamber now. There is this particular Report by the Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights. That is to be debated from 08th of September onwards for one whole month. That is going to take place in Geneva and I am sure the Government is getting ready to meet all the challenges that would be made in Geneva. But, what pertains here is some reference made to the Attorney-General\u2019s Department. This Government has gone on record saying that they will create a new Public Prosecutor's Office. That is a welcome move. But, let us take into account what the UN High Commissioner for Human Rights says in his Report. I quote:\n\n\"A key obstacle to justice has been the need for reform within the Attorney-General\u2019s office to ensure an independent prosecutorial authority to prosecute grave human rights violations. In its policy manifesto, the Government had pledged to introduce \u201ca Directorate of Public Prosecution\u201d, independent of the Attorney-General\u2019s Department. An expert committee has been established to study the establishment of an Independent Prosecutor\u2019s Office. The Government reported that a Committee has been tasked to develop initial proposals and that feedback from public, the Human Rights Commission of Sri Lanka and civil society would be sought on the draft concept paper.\" \u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0dca\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dd4 \u0dba (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b95\u0bc1\u0bb4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Chairperson of Committees) \u0db1\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0d9c\u0dda\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db8\u0dcf, \u0d94\u0dbd\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dbd \u0dab\u0dc0 \u0dd2\u0dc1 \u0dcf\u0da9\u0dd2 \u0dca\u200d\u0dda\u0dda \u0dda\u0dcf\u0dbd \u0d8b \u0d9a\u0dca\u0d9a\u0dba \u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dda."
