    "chunk_text": "2. In the post-conflict period starting from 2009, 23,850.72 acres of land were under the control of the tri-forces. Those lands have been gradually released, but 2,583.05 acres still remain to be released. Of that, 2,025.80 acres are yet to be released in Valikamam North alone.\n\n235 236\n\n[ \u0dbb\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0d85\u0dcf \u0daf\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dca\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0daf\u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dca\u0dcf]\n\n2025 :\u0dd0\u0dda\u0dad\u0dca\u0dd0 \u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca\u0daf10\n\nelectricity connections and internal roads for those who were displaced by the war and have since been resettled. 5 & 6. The resettlement programme is directly linked to\n\nthe release of land by the relevant authorities. Accordingly, lands are being released in a phased manner based on security clearance, administrative requirements and the availability of essential infrastructure facilities. This programme is processing in line with the release of land by the respective agencies. However, as the programme is fully dependent on the timing of land releases, it is not possible at this stage to specify an exact date for the completion of the resettlement process. We started this process in April. By August, within five months, we have released 57 acres in the Jaffna District alone.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0da5\u0dcf\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8 \u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0bbf\u0bb5\u0b9e\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0bbf\u0bb1\u0bc0\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0ba9\u0bcd) (The Hon. Sivagnanam Shritharan) \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bcc\u0bb0\u0bb5 \u0b85\u0b95\u0bae\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb2\u0bb3, \u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b95\u0b9f \u0b85\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0b95\u0bae\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba8\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0bbf!"
